      "message": "[warning] Line 149: 🟡 `allowsSend` treats missing grants as allowed (`guard let granted \u003d granted else { return true }`), which undermines the stricter policy introduced elsewhere (`SwarmSendPolicy` says missing grants must not allow sends). Because `allowsPublishing` is now used to filter forwarding targets, conversations with unavailable/unknown grants can still appear selectable and then fail at dispatch time. Align this path with the policy by default-denying when grants are missing for publishing checks (or by using `SwarmSendPolicy.canPublish` directly in picker filtering).",
